### Student report
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/students/STUDENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Challenge report
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/challenges/CHALLENGE_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Course report
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/courses/COURSE_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Leaderboard by course
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/leaderboard?courseId=COURSE_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Leaderboard by evaluation
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/leaderboard?evaluationId=EVALUATION_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN